    "outcome": {
      "ja": "球対称1s²のHeをRHFと交換のみLDAで解き、SCF収束・エネルギー・電子数を独立な有限基底参照と照合する。",
      "en": "Solve spherical 1s² helium with RHF and exchange-only LDA; compare SCF convergence, energies and electron count with independent finite-basis references."
    },
    "formula": {
      "role": "approximation",
      "latex": [
        "\\left[\\hat h_r+\\frac12v_H[n]\\right]u=\\varepsilon u\\quad(\\mathrm{He}\\;1s^2\\ \\mathrm{RHF})",
        "\\left[\\hat h_r+v_H[n]+v_x^{\\rm LDA}(n)\\right]u=\\varepsilon u,\\qquad v_x^{\\rm LDA}=-\\left(\\frac{3n}{\\pi}\\right)^{1/3}",
        "\\hat h_r=-\\frac12\\frac{d^2}{dr^2}-\\frac2r,\\qquad n(r)=\\frac{2|u(r)|^2}{4\\pi r^2}"
      ],
      "note": {
        "ja": "孤立・球対称・閉殻1s²に限定した原子単位の動径式。RHFのvH/2は2電子同一空間軌道に特有。LDAは交換のみで相関なし。UHF、GGA、hybrid、一般分子・周期DFTの実行例ではない。",
        "en": "Atomic-unit radial equations restricted to isolated spherical closed-shell 1s² helium. The RHF vH/2 form is specific to two electrons sharing one spatial orbital. LDA is exchange-only, without correlation; no UHF, GGA, hybrid, general molecular or periodic-DFT example."
      }
    },
